1
00:01:00,759 --> 00:01:01,320
As the story goes,

2
00:01:01,880 --> 00:01:04,079
the Li family has lost three wives in succession.

3
00:01:04,640 --> 00:01:06,239
They appear as soon as night falls.

4
00:01:06,920 --> 00:01:08,359
And not long ago,

5
00:01:08,359 --> 00:01:10,400
Li's daughter, Mengzhu, also died.

6
00:01:10,719 --> 00:01:12,400
They say only a ghost marriage

7
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:15,239
can appease the dead's resentment.

8
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,439
The Classic of Lu Ban states,

9
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:21,319
"A door taller than the hall

10
00:01:21,480 --> 00:01:22,319
means the family line will fall."

11
00:01:23,480 --> 00:01:24,920
The architectural layout of the Li mansion

12
00:01:25,799 --> 00:01:27,319
is actually designed to end their bloodline.

13
00:01:28,959 --> 00:01:30,640
The layout of the front hall is odd too.

14
00:01:31,920 --> 00:01:33,640
The front road forms the 'fire' character.

15
00:01:34,480 --> 00:01:36,159
When the yearly curse strikes,
disaster follows.

16
00:01:37,319 --> 00:01:38,319
When building a house,

17
00:01:39,239 --> 00:01:40,760
why curse the people living in it

18
00:01:40,879 --> 00:01:41,840
with such endless misfortune?

19
00:01:41,840 --> 00:01:42,400
Kneel!

20
00:01:44,920 --> 00:01:47,680
Heaven and Earth as witness,
let the souls return.

21
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:51,200
Yin and Yang in harmony,
bringing eternal peace.

22
00:01:51,840 --> 00:01:54,239
A ghost marriage sealed with wine,
their destinies bound.

23
00:01:54,959 --> 00:01:58,560
Li Mengzhu and Jiang Huai are now husband and wife.

24
00:01:59,280 --> 00:02:01,680
Escort them to the mourning hall!

25
00:02:05,840 --> 00:02:06,719
A ghost!

26
00:02:07,040 --> 00:02:08,439
The madam's ghost has returned!

27
00:02:09,039 --> 00:02:10,080
A ghost!

28
00:02:21,439 --> 00:02:22,680
I'm just a storyteller.

29
00:02:22,960 --> 00:02:24,400
How did I end up like this?

30
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:28,759
It all started three days ago.

31
00:02:49,879 --> 00:02:52,599
Such a beautiful bride.

32
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,960
Will you return to the Palace of the
King of Hell

33
00:02:56,599 --> 00:02:59,800
and be a ghost couple for eternity?

34
00:03:07,039 --> 00:03:07,639
Master.

35
00:03:08,159 --> 00:03:09,719
We're still five li away from Lijia Town.

36
00:03:10,719 --> 00:03:11,879
It's getting pretty late.

37
00:03:12,360 --> 00:03:14,080
Let's just make do and spend the night here.

38
00:03:15,719 --> 00:03:16,360
It seems...

39
00:03:17,199 --> 00:03:18,039
...we have no other choice.

40
00:03:18,759 --> 00:03:19,639
We'll spend the night here.

41
00:03:39,120 --> 00:03:40,680
There's a ghost, Master!

42
00:03:41,719 --> 00:03:42,520
It's all your fault!

43
00:03:42,919 --> 00:03:44,439
I went through so much trouble to set that trap,

44
00:03:44,599 --> 00:03:45,719
and you just had to ruin it!

45
00:03:46,240 --> 00:03:47,599
Once I catch the killer behind

46
00:03:47,800 --> 00:03:48,520
the King of Hell's wedding, you'll pay!

47
00:03:51,319 --> 00:03:52,400
The King of Hell's wedding...

48
00:04:17,120 --> 00:04:18,199
The corpse exhibits adipocere.

49
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:21,240
The lividity is dark brown.

50
00:04:23,839 --> 00:04:24,800
You were poisoned.

51
00:04:31,879 --> 00:04:33,639
Clothes scented with twelve spices.

52
00:04:34,439 --> 00:04:35,120
Very refined.

53
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,319
Your family runs a spice shop.

54
00:04:46,879 --> 00:04:47,879
The King of Hell got away.

55
00:04:48,000 --> 00:04:48,639
It's all your fault.

56
00:04:49,439 --> 00:04:50,120
Be quiet.

57
00:04:52,839 --> 00:04:53,680
What's he doing?

58
00:04:54,839 --> 00:04:56,240
This is my master's ultimate technique.

59
00:04:56,600 --> 00:04:57,680
Five-Sense Deduction.

60
00:04:58,439 --> 00:04:59,759
My master uses sight,

61
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:01,879
hearing,

62
00:05:03,480 --> 00:05:04,120
smell,

63
00:05:05,879 --> 00:05:06,439
taste,

64
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:08,519
and touch.

65
00:05:09,040 --> 00:05:09,920
Combining these five senses,

66
00:05:10,079 --> 00:05:11,519
and through meditation,

67
00:05:11,639 --> 00:05:13,680
he can discover overlooked clues.

68
00:05:13,879 --> 00:05:14,639
Just wait and see.

69
00:05:16,519 --> 00:05:18,240
You're the young lady of the spice shop.

70
00:05:19,240 --> 00:05:20,120
After being poisoned,

71
00:05:20,879 --> 00:05:21,879
you were forced to marry the King of Hell.

72
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,720
You never agreed to marry him.

73
00:05:32,040 --> 00:05:32,839
Then who was that just now?

74
00:05:43,839 --> 00:05:44,560
I get it now.

75
00:05:48,160 --> 00:05:48,680
He's awake.

76
00:05:48,920 --> 00:05:49,639
He's awake.

77
00:05:51,399 --> 00:05:52,639
Spouting mumbo jumbo.

78
00:05:53,480 --> 00:05:55,560
I think you're in cahoots with the King of Hell.

79
00:05:55,680 --> 00:05:56,240
Ow, ow, ow!

80
00:05:56,240 --> 00:05:56,920
Let's talk this out.

81
00:05:56,920 --> 00:05:57,759
Could you let go first?

82
00:05:57,800 --> 00:05:58,319
Spill it!

83
00:05:58,439 --> 00:05:59,279
How about I help you solve the case?

84
00:05:59,279 --> 00:06:00,079
Master, help!

85
00:06:00,199 --> 00:06:00,959
Let go, let go, let go!

86
00:06:01,720 --> 00:06:02,160
Let me see.

87
00:06:02,439 --> 00:06:02,920
Are you okay?

88
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,639
I'm fine, I'm fine.

89
00:06:04,199 --> 00:06:04,720
As long as you're okay.

90
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:06,519
How will you solve the case?

91
00:06:08,279 --> 00:06:09,000
This female corpse...

92
00:06:09,839 --> 00:06:11,000
...you placed it here on purpose...

93
00:06:11,560 --> 00:06:12,560
...to lure out that King of Hell, right?

94
00:06:12,759 --> 00:06:13,240
Yes.

95
00:06:14,000 --> 00:06:14,800
For over a month now,

96
00:06:15,120 --> 00:06:17,800
newlywed brides in Lijia Town
have been dropping dead.

97
00:06:18,600 --> 00:06:19,800
And while waiting to be buried,

98
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,839
their bodies mysteriously vanished.

99
00:06:25,839 --> 00:06:26,959
The villagers all say

100
00:06:27,240 --> 00:06:28,959
if a bride catches the King of Hell's eye,

101
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,680
her body will be taken by him.

102
00:06:30,879 --> 00:06:31,759
I don't buy it at all.

103
00:06:32,480 --> 00:06:34,519
This King of Hell taking a bride is pure nonsense.

104
00:06:34,800 --> 00:06:35,439
If you ask me,

105
00:06:35,839 --> 00:06:37,000
it's just murder for money.

106
00:06:38,360 --> 00:06:41,160
I was going to catch him red-handed today.

107
00:06:41,560 --> 00:06:42,199
It's all your fault

108
00:06:42,639 --> 00:06:43,399
for ruining my plan.

109
00:06:49,759 --> 00:06:50,240
Who?

110
00:06:51,040 --> 00:06:51,600
Who's there?

111
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,079
You are...

112
00:06:53,519 --> 00:06:54,079
Inspector Mu!

113
00:06:54,680 --> 00:06:55,680
Old newsman!

114
00:06:55,720 --> 00:06:56,560
Why is it you again?

115
00:06:56,680 --> 00:06:57,759
How many times do I have to say it?

116
00:06:58,040 --> 00:06:59,120
While the police are investigating,

117
00:06:59,279 --> 00:07:00,519
you must not spread false information!

118
00:07:00,680 --> 00:07:02,000
Stop making things up in your tabloid.

119
00:07:02,199 --> 00:07:03,360
I didn't! This is...

120
00:07:03,519 --> 00:07:03,959
Just go, go, go.

121
00:07:03,959 --> 00:07:04,560
Don't interfere with my case.

122
00:07:05,000 --> 00:07:05,519
No, but you...

123
00:07:05,759 --> 00:07:06,680
- Give me back my pen! - I don't have it!

124
00:07:06,879 --> 00:07:07,279
Go away!

125
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,480
My family heirloom pen! I...

126
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:13,399
Um,

127
00:07:13,720 --> 00:07:14,519
Lady Inspector,

128
00:07:15,839 --> 00:07:17,560
are you looking for that King of Hell?

129
00:07:17,879 --> 00:07:18,600
I know where he is.

130
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:23,279
Just making things up as you go?

131
00:07:25,560 --> 00:07:26,000
The King of Hell...

132
00:07:26,600 --> 00:07:27,360
...is eight chi tall,

133
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,160
wearing white-edged cloth shoes.

134
00:07:29,800 --> 00:07:30,519
On his hands,

135
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,720
is adipocere from the corpse's face.

136
00:07:33,279 --> 00:07:35,000
If you chase him west for five li,

137
00:07:35,360 --> 00:07:36,279
the first person you meet

138
00:07:36,839 --> 00:07:37,399
will be the King of Hell.

139
00:07:38,959 --> 00:07:39,800
How do you know that?

140
00:07:40,600 --> 00:07:41,319
Master...

141
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:46,879
Not only do I know where he is,

142
00:07:47,319 --> 00:07:49,120
I also know his motive for impersonating

143
00:07:49,319 --> 00:07:52,600
the King of Hell to kill brides.

144
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:53,959
What is it?

145
00:07:54,399 --> 00:07:55,759
Tell me! Don't keep me in suspense!

146
00:07:57,480 --> 00:07:58,920
Once you catch him yourself,

147
00:07:59,279 --> 00:08:00,000
check his pockets,

148
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,519
and you'll have the answer.

149
00:08:02,879 --> 00:08:03,480
Also,

150
00:08:03,959 --> 00:08:04,879
if you don't go after him now,

151
00:08:05,519 --> 00:08:06,519
it'll be too late.

152
00:08:07,680 --> 00:08:08,600
You should've said so!

153
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,160
Master,

154
00:08:11,360 --> 00:08:12,600
do you really know the King of Hell?

155
00:08:13,279 --> 00:08:14,240
Then who is he?

156
00:08:14,879 --> 00:08:16,079
Of course I don't know him!

157
00:08:16,879 --> 00:08:18,199
Stop imagining things!

158
00:08:27,560 --> 00:08:29,439
Dry weather,

159
00:08:29,759 --> 00:08:32,399
beware of fire!

160
00:08:35,720 --> 00:08:37,000
Run five li west.

161
00:08:37,200 --> 00:08:38,559
The first you meet is the King of Hell.

162
00:08:38,879 --> 00:08:40,200
Eight chi tall,

163
00:08:40,759 --> 00:08:41,720
white-edged cloth shoes.

164
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:43,000
He has adipocere on his hands.

165
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:44,480
That's him.

166
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:46,639
Dry weath-

167
00:08:48,720 --> 00:08:49,080
Don't move!

168
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:51,279
You're the King of Hell's wedding killer!

169
00:08:52,279 --> 00:08:53,200
I'm innocent! I'm innocent!

170
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:56,039
I'm just a night watchman!

171
00:08:56,879 --> 00:08:58,080
I'm no King of Hell!

172
00:08:58,240 --> 00:08:58,720
Master.

173
00:08:59,320 --> 00:09:00,200
Are you sure about this?

174
00:09:00,679 --> 00:09:02,399
How can a watchman be the King of Hell?

175
00:09:02,879 --> 00:09:04,519
He was caught stealing corpses
as the King of Hell. Get up!

176
00:09:05,399 --> 00:09:07,440
The ruined temple is in the wilderness
with nowhere to hide.

177
00:09:08,120 --> 00:09:09,120
His safest bet

178
00:09:09,559 --> 00:09:10,559
was to flee to Lijia Town

179
00:09:10,720 --> 00:09:11,519
and become himself again.

180
00:09:20,679 --> 00:09:21,519
Still denying it?

181
00:09:22,480 --> 00:09:24,759
You specifically targeted the wives
of wealthy families

182
00:09:24,879 --> 00:09:26,080
just for this gold jewelry.

183
00:09:26,759 --> 00:09:27,720
It was our boss.

184
00:09:28,480 --> 00:09:30,480
He set his sights on the gold
in the Li family's shop.

185
00:09:30,720 --> 00:09:31,639
He told me to...

186
00:09:36,399 --> 00:09:36,840
Who's there?

187
00:09:39,679 --> 00:09:41,399
Now the fake King of Hell will meet
the real King of Hell.

188
00:09:42,440 --> 00:09:44,120
Posing as the King of Hell to steal gold

189
00:09:44,960 --> 00:09:46,519
was just their diversion.

190
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:48,360
Actually, their real target

191
00:09:49,320 --> 00:09:50,200
is the Li family's gold shop.

192
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:32,720
Life for life, gold breeds gold
